        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "\"Bizarre\" pattern of weaving: two lengths seamed at center; left length pieced at top; selveges intact. Pattern of double line undulating stem in white silk with flowers, large cornucopia and cartouche forms in pink and white silk and gilt-silver yarns; purple lampas ground with floral motifs. Good condition, a few worn places and repairs."@en ;
